al others, we're waiting to see how their careers will turn out.","published":"2023-11-15T14:55:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/38895893/how-top-50-2023-recruits-done-college-freshmen","type":"Story","byline":"Blake Baumgartner and Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Raylen Wilson, No. 57 football recruit in ESPN Junior 300, commits to Michigan Wolverines","description":"Linebacker Raylen Wilson, the No. 57-ranked recruit in the ESPN Junior 300 out of Tallahassee (Florida) Lincoln, has committed to Michigan over Georgia.","published":"2024-01-23T15:55:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/recruiting/football/story/_/id/32823300/raylen-wilson-no-57-football-recruit-espn-junior-300-commits-michigan-wolverines","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Rivalry Week live: Top plays and playoff analysis","description":"It's the final week of the regular season. Here are the best plays, moments and CFP implications.","published":"2026-11-27T13:41:19.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50596213/rivalry-week-live-cfp-takeaways","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-27T12:39:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Inside the Pac-12's flex schedule decision to boost Boise State","description":"A look at how the Pac-12 ironed out its first flex week football schedule.","published":"2026-11-27T12:30:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592934/pac-12-flex-schedule-boise-state-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What rivalries have the biggest stakes? Connelly looks at the end of the season","description":"Among 20 big games, some classic rivalries have fallen down the pecking order.","published":"2026-11-27T12:25:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595179/connelly-rivalry-week-stakes-preview","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Best friends Pat Surtain II, Jaylen Waddle ecstatic about reuniting with Broncos","description":"Surtain and Waddle bonded immediately at Alabama six years ago and have embraced the chance to play together again in Denver on a team with Super Bowl hopes.","published":"2026-11-27T11:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50595313/pat-surtain-ii-jaylen-waddle-broncos-alabama-best-friends","type":"Story","byline":"Jeff Legwold","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top DE D.J. Jacobs commits to Miami hours after pulling Ohio State commitment","description":"Five-star defensive end D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, committed to Miami on Thursday hours after pulling his commitment from Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-26T22:58:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606746/top-de-recruit-dj-jacobs-commits-miami-hours-decommitting-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"D.J. Jacobs decommits from Ohio State, sources say, making top DE available again","description":"D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, has decommitted from Ohio State, sources told ESPN, with Tennessee, Georgia and Miami among the leading contenders for the five-star defensive end.","published":"2026-11-26T21:21:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606035/sources-de-dj-jacobs-decommits-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Friday Night Lights,' 'Ted Lasso' top poll ranking 21st-century sports shows","description":"A Seton Hall poll crowns America's favorite modern fictional sports TV series.﻿","published":"2026-11-26T16:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4871074/raylen-wilson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raylen_Wilson"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Raylen Wilson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raylen_Wilson","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:20Z","intro":"Raylen Akin Wilson (born July 7, 2005) is an American college football linebacker for the Georgia Bulldogs of the Southeastern Conference (SEC).","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Wilson attended Lincoln High School in Tallahassee, Florida. As a senior, he had 117 tackles and as a senior and junior, he was the Tallahassee Democrat All-Big Bend Defensive Player of the Year. A five-star recruit, Wilson was selected to play in the 2023 Under Armour All-America Game. He originally committed to the University of Michigan to play college football but switched to the University of Georgia."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Georgia in 2023, Wilson played in 12 games with one start and had 15 tackles and 0.5 sacks. He returned to Georgia for his sophomore year in 2024."}],"family":[{"relation":"Father","name":"Robert Wilson","description":"American footballer, born 1974","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Wilson_(wide_receiver)"}]}}